title: Build What the Left Does Not Own
subtitle: There is no friendly national ecosystem waiting to carry the message.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_local_media_ecosystem_timer <= 0 and media_event_done = 1 and (media_capacity < 55 or republika_capacity + kanal_zero_capacity > media_capacity)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_local_media_ecosystem_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/deck_party.svg

= Build What the Left Does Not Own

Republika is becoming a movement institution. Liberal outlets can amplify the
Left when interests align and erase it when they do not. A national television
station is fantasy, but smaller investments could create habits and audiences
that survive one viral clip.

- @regional_correspondents
- @movement_studios
- @party_channel

@regional_correspondents
title: Fund a network of regional correspondents
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Slow national growth and durable local relevance.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A real regional network requires two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; media_capacity += 5; local_network += 6; public_trust += 2; barons_dissent -= 2; organiser_energy += 2; rural_support += 3; pensioner_support += 1; turnout_readiness += 2; news_headline = "Regional stories begin travelling through a Left network"

Hospitals, workplaces, tenants and bus routes replace Warsaw intrigue in the
daily feed. Regional organisers acquire useful footage—and a reason to keep
answering headquarters.

- #poland_card_finish

@movement_studios
title: Equip independent movement studios
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Credible allies retain editorial independence.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Equipment and production support require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_capacity += 4; movement_autonomy += 5; feminist_trust += 3; progressive_credibility += 2; party_unity -= 1; barons_dissent += 2; women_support += 2; young_support += 2; urban_progressive_support += 2; news_headline = "Independent allies refuse to read party copy"

Tenant and feminist organisers receive production help and retain the right to
criticise the alliance. Headquarters dislikes the second part. Audiences believe
them because of it.

- #poland_card_finish

@party_channel
title: Launch an openly partisan video channel
subtitle: Free, cheap and reliable—with a hard credibility ceiling.
on-arrival: media_capacity += 3; barons_strength += 2; public_trust -= 2; movement_autonomy -= 2; party_unity += 1; pensioner_support += 1; turnout_readiness += 1; news_headline = "The Left can finally broadcast to itself"

The channel produces clean clips, regular briefings and almost no accidental
dissent. Most viewers already planned to vote Left, but at least the archive now
exists.

- #poland_card_finish
